losed.Fixed incorrect display scaling on startup when using extended dual-monitor displays.Fixed a sound effect sometimes playing twice during certain events. Thanks for all the reports on the community hub — keep them comi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T07:32:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035298","verified_at":"2026-10-23T12:06:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3797870-1846651706693539","game_id":"steam-3797870","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.1.2 is here!","summary":"🆕 New Added two new ground tiles — Brick Floor and Wood Floor — alongside the existing cobblestone and sleeper paths, so you can decorate your farm exactly how you like.🔧 Improved You can now re-lay the ground/decorative floor tile under a building without relocating it first.Adjusted the speech tone for some character dialogue.🐛 Fixed Fixed a bug where obstacles spanning 2+ tiles couldn’t be removed if only part of them had been revealed through the fog.We’ll keep rolling out updates throughout","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T03:17:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693539","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3797870-1846018067931903","game_id":"steam-3797870","kind":"announcement","title":"Free Demo Out Now!","summary":"The free demo for Rabby's Rainbow Farm is now available, starting today, October 9, 2026!Watch over Rabby and friends as they tend a cozy farm in the corner of your desktop — a desktop companion game you can enjoy right alongside your everyday work. This demo lets you play through the opening portion of the game.▼ Try the free demo hereGot feedback, suggestions, or found a bug? Please let